      "message": "Done. BTW I mainly imitated DawnGraphicsPipeline here but I wonder why do we want to avoid assigning a label in a release build? IMO labeling pipelines is useful in release builds too, e.g. when reading through a frame capture.\n\nP.S.: Following up on our conversation on the Skia GPU chat, I\u0027m removing the compile-time conditional and always assigning a label here. I went ahead and updated DawnGraphicsPipeline as well.",
